      "cooked": "<p>Same blog’s got a new post up and it’s a doozy.  Whole slew of random charts for determining what the aliens are up to in your supers game, who they are, what kind of servants and allies they have, and where their main base is hidden.  Pretty cool inspiration source.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://elfmaidsandoctopi.blogspot.com/2024/06/marvel-1955-mysterious-alien-encounters.html\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/77730c553b6acfb4a3b9f1747fc4a0485dd88550.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://elfmaidsandoctopi.blogspot.com/2024/06/marvel-1955-mysterious-alien-encounters.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">elfmaidsandoctopi.blogspot.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:374/500;\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7412ae50a09dc67da1870878d84d344352d19bee_2_374x500.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"374\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7412ae50a09dc67da1870878d84d344352d19bee_2_374x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7412ae50a09dc67da1870878d84d344352d19bee.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7412ae50a09dc67da1870878d84d344352d19bee.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7412ae50a09dc67da1870878d84d344352d19bee_2_10x10.png\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://elfmaidsandoctopi.blogspot.com/2024/06/marvel-1955-mysterious-alien-encounters.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Marvel 1955 Mysterious Alien  Encounters</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Recently players in my campaign have become leading alien fighters and privy to super secret global talks about plans for three orbital nuc...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
